PLUGGING IN A REAL AI MODEL
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Out of the box this bot uses a local, template-based generator so it
works instantly with zero external dependencies or cost. If you want
real AI-generated captions, set the CAPTION_AI_API_KEY environment
variable and fill in `generate_caption_with_ai()` below with a call
to your provider of choice (Anthropic, OpenAI, etc). The rest of the
bot (commands, buttons, error handling) does not need to change.
---------------------------------------------------------------------
"""

